35) Asset price prediction

Now you can use a neural network to predict an asset price, which is a large component of quantitative financial analysis as well as risk management. You'll use the 2005-2010 stock prices of Citibank, Goldman Sachs and J. P. Morgan to train a network to predict the price of Morgan Stanley's stock. You'll create and train a neural network with one input layer, one output layer and two hidden layers.
